sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App
    participant AuthService
    participant SMSGateway

    User->>App: enter phone number
    App->>AuthService: request OTP
    AuthService->>SMSGateway: send OTP code
    SMSGateway-->>User: deliver OTP via SMS
    User->>App: enter OTP code
    App->>AuthService: verify OTP
    AuthService-->>App: OTP valid
